### A. TEXT SEQUENCE (3 messages)

Send as three separate messages. iMessage only renders the big link preview card
when a message contains nothing but the URL, so the link must be alone in its own
message.

```
[Message 1]
Appreciate the quick reply, <First>.

One more thing and then I'll leave you alone until <day>. I put everything on one
page so you're not digging back through the email.

[Message 2]
https://closewithcjclay.com/r/<slug>/

[Message 3]
If you only open one thing, make it the 4 minute clip at the top. It's from our
live call on the 18th. Four of our members talking about getting placed, and every
one of them had more than one offer to choose from.

Not homework. Totally optional. See you <day> at <time>.
```

If they did **not** reply to the resources email, replace Message 1 with:

```
Hey <First>, CJ here. Looking forward to <day> at <time>. Not sure the email
landed, so here is everything on one page instead.
```

